{"step_index":2397,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-26T16:59:34Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-26T16:59:34Z\nCompleted At: 2026-10-26T16:59:34Z\nShowing lines 1-49 of 49\n1: #!/usr/bin/env bash\n2: # make-cozo-device.sh: Create a pre-formatted 20 GiB sparse leaf + Cozo store image.\n3: # Layout:\n4: #   p1: 10 GiB Btrfs leaf (clean for in-container `btrfs device add`)\n5: #   p2: 10 GiB ext4 (pre-formatted for RocksDB/Cozo persistent store)\n6: set -euo pipefail\n7: \n8: usage() {\n9:     echo \"Usage: $0 <output-image-path> [total-gib (default: 20)]\"\n10:     echo \"Example: $0 /var/lib/op-dbus/identity-cozo/devices/id-1.img 20\"\n11:     exit 1\n12: }\n13: \n14: [[ $# -ge 1 ]] || usage\n15: IMAGE_PATH=$1\n16: TOTAL_GIB=${2:-20}\n17: \n18: [[ $(id -u) -eq 0 ]] || { echo \"Error: Must be run as root.\" >&2; exit 1; }\n19: \n20: mkdir -p \"$(dirname \"$IMAGE_PATH\")\"\n21: \n22: echo \"==> 1. Creating sparse raw image (${TOTAL_GIB} GiB) at ${IMAGE_PATH}...\"\n23: truncate -s \"${TOTAL_GIB}G\" \"${IMAGE_PATH}\"\n24: chmod 0600 \"${IMAGE_PATH}\"\n25: \n26: echo \"==> 2. Partitioning GPT: p1 (10G leaf), p2 (10G ext4 cozo)...\"\n27: sgdisk --clear \\\n28:     --new=1:2048:+10G --typecode=1:8300 --change-name=1:3tched-leaf \\\n29:     --new=2:0:0       --typecode=2:8300 --change-name=2:cozo-persist \\\n30:     \"${IMAGE_PATH}\"\n31: \n32: echo \"==> 3. Attaching loop device to format p2...\"\n33: LOOP_DEV=$(losetup --find --show --partscan \"${IMAGE_PATH}\")\n34: trap 'losetup -d \"${LOOP_DEV}\" 2>/dev/null || true' EXIT\n35: \n36: echo \"==> 4. Pre-formatting partition 2 as ext4 (allocate-on-write optimized)...\"\n37: mkfs.ext4 -F -L cozo-persist \\\n38:     -O 64bit,dir_index,extent,sparse_super2 \\\n39:     -m 1 \\\n40:     \"${LOOP_DEV}p2\"\n41: \n42: sync\n43: \n44: echo \"==> 5. Detaching loop device...\"\n45: losetup -d \"${LOOP_DEV}\"\n46: trap - EXIT\n47: \n48: echo \"==> Done! Pre-formatted device image ready at: ${IMAGE_PATH}\"\n49: ls -lh \"${IMAGE_PATH}\""}
{"step_index":2398,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-26T16:59:35Z","input_tokens":2106,"cache_read_tokens":183236,"output_tokens":1962,"thinking":"Considering whether the device script should format the first partition as Btrfs with a unique identifier or leave it raw for later addition to the filesystem. `device add` tool's behavior is dependent on the device's pre-existing state. If a filesystem is present, the \"force\" option is required, otherwise, the command will write a superblock to the raw device.\n\n\nThe device addition script leverages the `add device` functionality for Btrfs, conditionally adding the disk if it's raw. Partition `p2` is explicitly formatted with a unique identifier to avoid conflicts.\n\nThe provisioning script is designed to handle instance creation, including argument validation and profile registration. It will also prepare storage by either generating or cloning a device image and then updating the unique identifier of the second partition.\n\nThe script then materializes the instance configuration from a template, using it to create a new instance via an API call, and sets up device attachments to it.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"{\n  \"version\": 1,\n  \"schema\": \"3tched-container-manifest@v1\",\n  \"name\": \"3tched-container-assets\",\n  \"description\": \"Asset manifest and storage coordinates for modular 3tched container provisioning\",\n  \"storage_tier\": {\n    \"bucket_endpoint\": \"http://127.0.0.1:9000\",\n    \"bucket_name\": \"3tched-artifacts\",\n    \"artifacts\": {\n      \"seed_rootfs\": {\n        \"filename\": \"3tched-seed.img1\",\n        \"description\": \"Shared immutable base rootfs seed with 7 canonical agent subvolumes\",\n        \"authoritative_host_path\": \"/var/lib/incus/storage-pools/3tched/3tched-seed.img1\",\n        \"subvolumes\": [\n          \"@\",\n          \"@agent_memory\",\n          \"@agent_rules\",\n          \"@agent_shared\",\n          \"@agent_skills\",\n          \"@agent_soul\",\n          \"@agent_user\"\n        ]\n      },\n      \"cozo_template\": {\n        \"filename\": \"cozo-device-template-20g.img\",\n        \"description\": \"Pre-formatted 20G sparse image template (p1: 10G Btrfs leaf sprout, p2: 10G ext4 Cozo silo)\",\n        \"authoritative_host_path\": \"/var/lib/op-dbus/identity-cozo/templates/cozo-device-template-20g.img\",\n        \"layout\": {\n          \"p1_type\": \"btrfs\",\n          \"p1_size_gib\": 10,\n          \"p1_role\": \"leaf_sprout\",\n          \"p2_type\": \"ext4\",\n          \"p2_size_gib\": 10,\n          \"p2_role\": \"cozo_rocksdb_silo\"\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"endpoints\": {\n    \"qdrant_vector_brain\": \"http://127.0.0.1:6333\",\n    \"emqx_message_broker\": \"tcp://127.0.0.1:1883\",\n    \"door_grpc_admission\": \"https://10.0.0.2:8090\",\n    \"threetched_router\": \"http://127.0.0.1:8084\",\n    \"dashboard_web\": \"http://10.0.0.2:8080\"\n  },\n  \"invariants\": {\n    \"zero_docker\": true,\n    \"system_containers_only\": \"incus\",\n    \"nested_btrfs_prevention\": \"dir_pool_over_sparse_loop\",\n    \"identity_persistence\": \"cozo_rocksdb_on_ext4\",\n    \"door_protocol\": \"tonic_h2_grpc\"\n  }\n}\n","Overwrite":true,"Path":"/srv/git/3tched-container/assets/manifest.json"}}]}
