{"step_index":2411,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-26T17:00:45Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-26T17:00:45Z\nCompleted At: 2026-10-26T17:00:45Z\nShowing lines 1-45 of 45\n1: # 3tched-container: Modular Incus Identity Containers\n2: \n3: This repository contains the JSON specifications, Incus profiles, and storage automation for launching **3tchedFS identity system containers**.\n4: \n5: ## Architecture & Separation of Concerns\n6: \n7: 1. **Modular Separation**:\n8:    * The container runtime, Incus JSON profiles, and template definitions live here in `/srv/git/3tched-container`.\n9:    * The core D-Bus backend services and plugins reside in `/srv/git/odbus-verified`.\n10:    * The user-facing dashboard lives in `/srv/git/3tched.com`.\n11: \n12: 2. **Nested Btrfs Avoidance**:\n13:    * The container rootfs runs on Incus `identity-roots` (`dir` driver pool) rather than native host Btrfs subvolumes, avoiding the `op-storage-kernel-guard` nested Btrfs ioctl deny rules.\n14:    * Writable rootfs capacity is provided by attaching a discrete per-container image (`make-cozo-device.sh`) and running `btrfs device add` **inside the container**.\n15: \n16: 3. **Dedicated Ext4 Partition for Cozo / RocksDB**:\n17:    * To prevent Write-Ahead Log (WAL) and SST compaction fragmentation on Copy-on-Write Btrfs, Cozo's persistent store is backed by a dedicated **ext4** partition (`p2` of the attached image).\n18:    * RocksDB writes in pure allocate-on-write mode (`allow_fallocate = false`), keeping sparse images compact without un-sparsifying disk allocations.\n19: \n20: ## Directory Structure\n21: \n22: ```\n23: /srv/git/3tched-container/\n24: ├── instances/\n25: │   └── chatbot-template.json       # Pure JSON instance specification (config, devices, profiles)\n26: ├── profiles/\n27: │   └── 3tched-lungs.json           # JSON profile defining the /run/opdbus/lungs socket & fuse\n28: ├── storage/\n29: │   └── make-cozo-device.sh         # Creates pre-formatted 20G image (10G Btrfs leaf + 10G ext4 Cozo)\n30: ├── scripts/\n31: │   └── launch-identity.sh          # JSON-driven launcher: injects UUID/keys and boots\n32: └── README.md\n33: ```\n34: \n35: ## Quick Start\n36: \n37: ### 1. Pre-format a Cozo Storage Device\n38: ```bash\n39: sudo ./storage/make-cozo-device.sh /var/lib/op-dbus/identity-cozo/devices/id-1.img 20\n40: ```\n41: \n42: ### 2. Launch an Identity Container\n43: ```bash\n44: sudo ./scripts/launch-identity.sh id-1 '<wireguard_public_key>'\n45: ```"}
{"step_index":2412,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-26T17:00:45Z","input_tokens":3172,"cache_read_tokens":188767,"output_tokens":1100,"tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"# 3tched-container: Modular Incus Identity Containers\n\nThis repository contains the JSON specifications, Incus profiles, and storage automation for launching **sovereign 3tchedFS identity system containers**.\n\n---\n\n## Architecture: The Autonomic Living Entity\n\n1. **Modular Separation**:\n   * **Container Runtime & Identity Provisioning**: Maintained in this repository (`/srv/git/3tched-container`).\n   * **Core D-Bus Backend & Sealed Blobs**: Maintained in `/srv/git/odbus-verified`.\n   * **Generative UI Dashboard**: Maintained in `/srv/git/3tched.com`.\n\n2. **The Parallel Projections (`3tched` vs `threetched`)**:\n   * **`3tched` (Inward Viscera & Mind)**: Host mount `/run/mounts/3tchedFS`, OP-DBUS plugins, sealed catalog, and the 7 canonical subvolumes (`@agent_memory`, `@agent_soul`, `@agent_rules`, etc.).\n   * **`threetched` (Outward Sensory Shell)**: Host mount `/run/mounts/threetched`, router listening on loopback `8084`, and external skill adapters.\n   * Both projections are backed by the **exact same FUSE engine** and enforce the **exact same cryptographic identity**.\n\n3. **Nested Btrfs Avoidance & Writable Sprout**:\n   * Containers run on Incus `identity-roots` (`dir` pool) over the shared immutable seed, bypassing the host's `op-storage-kernel-guard` seccomp ioctl deny filter.\n   * Writable rootfs capacity is added atomically inside the container via `btrfs device add /dev/cozo-disk1 /` (sprouting the leaf).\n\n4. **Dedicated Ext4 Partition for Cozo / RocksDB**:\n   * To prevent Copy-on-Write write amplification during RocksDB SST compactions, Cozo's persistent store is backed by a dedicated **ext4** partition (`p2` of the attached image).\n   * Mounted to `/var/lib/op-dbus` inside the container namespace.\n\n5. **The Third Eye (FUSE Lungs)**:\n   * Containers have **no virtual NICs (`eth0`) and no local TCP/IP stack**.\n   * The Unix Domain Socket bound in `/run/opdbus/lungs` acts as the universal sensory organ (the Third Eye) connecting directly to the D-Bus control plane.\n\n---\n\n## Directory Structure\n\n```\n/srv/git/3tched-container/\n├── assets/\n│   └── manifest.json               # Asset coordinates, storage bucket URLs & checksums\n├── instances/\n│   └── chatbot-template.json       # Incus JSON instance specification\n├── profiles/\n│   └── 3tched-lungs.json           # Incus profile defining /run/opdbus/lungs and tmpfs /run\n├── storage/\n│   └── make-cozo-device.sh         # Generates 20G sparse image (10G Btrfs leaf + 10G ext4 Cozo)\n├── scripts/\n│   ├── provision-identity.sh       # Full 7-stage emergence provisioner with finish receipt\n│   ├── sync-upgrade.sh             # Boot-time atomic Btrfs send/receive OS layer sync\n│   └── launch-identity.sh          # Minimal direct instance launcher\n└── README.md\n```\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start: Provisioning a New Identity\n\n```bash\n# 1. Provision a new identity container\nsudo ./scripts/provision-identity.sh id-1 '<wireguard_public_key>' [session-id]\n\n# 2. Check the authoritative finish receipt\ncat /var/lib/op-dbus/identity-cozo/receipts/id-1.receipt.json\n\n# 3. Verify atomic upgrade sync\nsudo ./scripts/sync-upgrade.sh id-1\n```\n\n---\n\n## The 7-Stage Emergence Lifecycle\n\n```\n[1/7 GENESIS]   Binding cryptographic identity & SID1/OIA1 session\n[2/7 DNA]       Reflink-cloning pre-formatted somatic block device (10G leaf + 10G ext4)\n[3/7 SPINE]     Verifying 3tched-lungs FUSE neural profile in Incus\n[4/7 GESTATION] Materializing instance payload from template\n[5/7 AWAKEN]    Energizing container nervous system via Incus REST engine\n[6/7 BREATHE]   Mounting ext4 Cozo silo & sprouting Btrfs leaf onto rootfs\n[7/7 RECEIPT]   Sealing authoritative finish receipt to disk\n```\n","Overwrite":true,"Path":"/srv/git/3tched-container/README.md"}}]}
